# apps/web IS built (see apps/web/Dockerfile), so this cannot be a blanket
# `apps/` exclusion — that is what made services/subtitle-worker unbuildable.
# The heavy part of apps/web is node_modules and .next, both excluded below.
apps/cli
apps/docs
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
/workflows/
/scripts/
supabase/
# NOTE: do NOT ignore services/subtitle-worker/. Every service is built with the
# repo root as context, so ignoring it here made `docker compose build` and the
# GHCR release workflow fail with "/services/subtitle-worker/src: not found".
# The cost of shipping it in other services' contexts is a few KB of JS.
